# README requirements

- Use one `#` title and a short overview.
- Use numbered setup steps and state prerequisites when relevant.
- Add a language identifier to every fenced code block.
- Prefer Mermaid when a small diagram explains a structure or flow better than prose.
- State or link the project license.
